---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import SectionHeading from '../components/SectionHeading.astro';
import Button from '../components/Button.astro';

const breadcrumbs = [
  { name: 'Home', href: '/' },
  { name: 'Capabilities', href: '/#capabilities' },
  { name: 'AI-Native Engineering', href: '' },
];
---

<Base
  title="AI-Native Engineering Services | Substrate"
  description="Substrate helps enterprises design, build, deploy, and operate AI-native products, intelligent workflows, autonomous systems, and enterprise AI platforms. Engineering-first, production-ready."
>
<!-- 1. HERO -->
<section class="relative overflow-hidden py-24 md:py-40" aria-labelledby="hero-heading">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_top_right,_var(--c-accent-soft)_0%,_transparent_60%)] pointer-events-none" aria-hidden="true" />
  <div class="container-x relative z-10">
    <nav class="mb-10 text-sm text-ink-3">
      {breadcrumbs.map((crumb, idx) => (
        <span>
          {idx > 0 && ' / '}
          {crumb.href && idx < breadcrumbs.length - 1
            ? <a href={crumb.href} class="text-accent hover:underline">{crumb.name}</a>
            : <span class={idx === breadcrumbs.length - 1 ? 'font-medium text-ink' : ''}>{crumb.name}</span>
          }
        </span>
      ))}
    </nav>

    <div class="max-w-4xl" data-reveal-group>
      <p class="kicker text-accent mb-5" data-reveal>
        <span class="text-accent">01</span><span aria-hidden="true">&nbsp;—&nbsp;</span>AI-Native Engineering
      </p>
      <h1 id="hero-heading" class="display text-5xl md:text-[4.5rem] text-ink max-w-5xl" data-reveal>
        Design, build, and operate<br />AI-native systems that deliver.
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-6 text-lg md:text-xl text-ink-2 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed" data-reveal>
        AI-native engineering is the discipline of building production systems where intelligence is a first-class architectural primitive, not a bolt-on feature. Substrate helps organizations design, build, deploy, and operate AI-native products, intelligent workflows, autonomous systems, and enterprise AI platforms that create measurable business value.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-4" data-reveal>
        <Button href="/contact" variant="primary" size="md">Schedule an AI strategy consultation</Button>
        <Button href="#what-is" variant="secondary" size="md">Learn more</Button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-16 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3 max-w-4xl" data-reveal-group>
      <div class="border-t border-line pt-5" data-reveal>
        <p class="text-3xl font-display font-semibold text-accent">70%</p>
        <p class="text-sm text-ink-2 mt-1">Of AI proofs-of-concept never reach production — we engineer systems that ship</p>
      </div>
      <div class="border-t border-line pt-5" data-reveal>
        <p class="text-3xl font-display font-semibold text-accent">3-6x</p>
        <p class="text-sm text-ink-2 mt-1">Faster delivery of AI capabilities with platform-driven development</p>
      </div>
      <div class="border-t border-line pt-5" data-reveal>
        <p class="text-3xl font-display font-semibold text-accent">40%</p>
        <p class="text-sm text-ink-2 mt-1">Average reduction in AI infrastructure costs through optimized model serving</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- 2. WHAT IS AI-NATIVE ENGINEERING? -->
<section id="what-is" class="py-20 md:py-28 bg-graphite" aria-labelledby="whatis-heading">
  <div class="container-x">
    <SectionHeading
      id="whatis-heading"
      index="02"
      label="What is AI-Native Engineering"
      title="Intelligence as a first-class architectural primitive."
      lede="AI-native engineering treats AI capabilities as core architectural components, not isolated experiments. It is the discipline of designing, building, and operating production systems where intelligence is embedded at every layer of the stack."
      tone="graphite"
    />

    <div class="mt-14 grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-16" data-reveal-group>
      <div data-reveal>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-display font-semibold text-graphite-fg mb-4">Definition and core principles</h3>
        <p class="text-graphite-fg-2 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          AI-native engineering is the practice of designing and building software systems where AI capabilities are fundamental to the architecture, not added as an afterthought. Models, embeddings, agents, retrieval systems, and evaluation pipelines are designed as first-class components alongside databases, APIs, and user interfaces.
        </p>
        <p class="text-graphite-fg-2 leading-relaxed">
          Core principles include: intelligence is composed, not monolithic; evaluation is continuous; humans remain in the loop; and infrastructure is AI-optimized. These principles ensure that systems are maintainable, trustworthy, and cost-effective at scale.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div data-reveal>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-display font-semibold text-graphite-fg mb-4">AI-native vs. AI-enabled applications</h3>
        <p class="text-graphite-fg-2 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          An AI-enabled application takes an existing application and adds an AI feature. An AI-native application is architected from the ground up with intelligence as a core concern. This distinction determines whether AI becomes a competitive advantage or a cost center.
        </p>
        <p class="text-graphite-fg-2 leading-relaxed">
          AI-native systems have data pipelines designed to feed models, APIs that return structured data optimized for LLM consumption, workflows that include model inference and human review as standard steps, and evaluation built into CI/CD. The system improves continuously through usage data rather than requiring manual retraining cycles.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div data-reveal>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-display font-semibold text-graphite-fg mb-4">Why organizations are investing now</h3>
        <p class="text-graphite-fg-2 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Organizations that embed intelligence into their core products and operations see measurable improvements in customer experience, operational efficiency, and revenue growth. Early adopters in financial services, healthcare, and SaaS are building defensible moats through AI capabilities that competitors cannot easily replicate.
        </p>
        <p class="text-graphite-fg-2 leading-relaxed">
          The cost of inaction is equally measurable. Companies that treat AI as an add-on find themselves rebuilding architectures within 18 months. The investments made today in AI architecture, data infrastructure, and engineering practices determine competitive positioning for the next decade.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div data-reveal>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-display font-semibold text-graphite-fg mb-4">Common misconceptions</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-3">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-graphite-fg-2">
            <span class="block h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent-bright mt-2 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true" />
            <span><strong class="text-graphite-fg">AI-native does not mean replacing everything.</strong> Most organizations adopt AI-native practices incrementally.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-graphite-fg-2">
            <span class="block h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent-bright mt-2 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true" />
            <span><strong class="text-graphite-fg">It is not only about large language models.</strong> SLMs, embeddings, computer vision, and classical ML all matter.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-graphite-fg-2">
            <span class="block h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent-bright mt-2 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true" />
            <span><strong class="text-graphite-fg">Autonomous does not mean unsupervised.</strong> Production AI uses human-in-the-loop patterns.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-graphite-fg-2">
            <span class="block h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent-bright mt-2 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true" />
            <span><strong class="text-graphite-fg">AI infrastructure is not just GPUs.</strong> Model serving, vector databases, evaluation, and governance are equally critical.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-graphite-fg-2">
            <span class="block h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent-bright mt-2 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true" />
            <span><strong class="text-graphite-fg">AI-native engineering is not a product you buy.</strong> It is an engineering discipline that requires skilled teams and organizational commitment.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- 3. BUSINESS CHALLENGES -->
<section class="py-20 md:py-28" aria-labelledby="challenges-heading">
  <div class="container-x">
    <SectionHeading
      id="challenges-heading"
      index="03"
      label="Business Challenges"
      title="The barriers to production AI are engineering challenges, not model challenges."
      lede="Organizations across every industry face a consistent set of obstacles when attempting to move from AI experimentation to production. These are the patterns we encounter and solve."
    />

    <div class="mt-14 grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3" data-reveal-group>
      <div class="rounded-lg border border-line-2 bg-paper p-6" data-reveal>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
          <span class="flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-accent-soft text-sm font-semibold text-accent">01</span>
          <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-ink">Disconnected AI initiatives</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-ink-2 leading-relaxed">Teams experiment with AI independently, creating duplicated effort, incompatible solutions, and no shared infrastructure or learning.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-lg border border-line-2 bg-paper p-6" data-reveal>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
          <span class="flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-accent-soft text-sm font-semibold text-accent">02</span>
          <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-ink">Proof-of-concept stagnation</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-ink-2 leading-relaxed">Promising prototypes never reach production due to missing engineering rigor, lack of production infrastructure, and no operational practices for AI systems.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-lg border border-line-2 bg-paper p-6" data-reveal>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
          <span class="flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-accent-soft text-sm font-semibold text-accent">03</span>
          <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-ink">Legacy architecture limitations</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-ink-2 leading-relaxed">Existing applications were not designed for AI integration. Monolithic codebases and rigid data models make it difficult to embed intelligent capabilities.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-lg border border-line-2 bg-paper p-6" data-reveal>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
          <span class="flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-accent-soft text-sm font-semibold text-accent">04</span>
          <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-ink">Poor data quality and access</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-ink-2 leading-relaxed">Fragmented data sources, inconsistent schemas, and poor data governance prevent models from delivering accurate results.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-lg border border-line-2 bg-paper p-6" data-reveal>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
          <span class="flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-accent-soft text-sm font-semibold text-accent">05</span>
          <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-ink">Model governance challenges</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-ink-2 leading-relaxed">Without centralized model registry and approval workflows, organizations cannot track which models are in production or when they need updating.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-lg border border-line-2 bg-paper p-6" data-reveal>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
          <span class="flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-accent-soft text-sm font-semibold text-accent">06</span>
          <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-ink">Security and privacy risks</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-ink-2 leading-relaxed">AI systems introduce new attack surfaces: prompt injection, data leakage, and compliance violations with regulated data.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-lg border border-line-2 bg-paper p-6" data-reveal>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
          <span class="flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-accent-soft text-sm font-semibold text-accent">07</span>
          <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-ink">High infrastructure costs</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-ink-2 leading-relaxed">GPU instances, model serving endpoints, and API calls accumulate costs rapidly without proper architecture, caching, and cost governance.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-lg border border-line-2 bg-paper p-6" data-reveal>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
          <span class="flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-accent-soft text-sm font-semibold text-accent">08</span>
          <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-ink">Slow experimentation cycles</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-ink-2 leading-relaxed">Data scientists spend weeks on environment setup and data pipeline construction rather than iterating on model performance.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-lg border border-line-2 bg-paper p-6" data-reveal>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
          <span class="flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-accent-soft text-sm font-semibold text-accent">09</span>
          <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-ink">AI expertise scarcity</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-ink-2 leading-relaxed">Qualified AI engineers and LLMOps practitioners are in high demand. Most organizations lack internal expertise to operate production AI systems.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-lg border border-line-2 bg-paper p-6" data-reveal>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
          <span class="flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-accent-soft text-sm font-semibold text-accent">10</span>
          <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-ink">Scaling AI workloads</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-ink-2 leading-relaxed">Patterns that work for 100 users fail at 10,000 without proper scaling architecture and load management.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-lg border border-line-2 bg-paper p-6" data-reveal>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
          <span class="flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-accent-soft text-sm font-semibold text-accent">11</span>
          <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-ink">Vendor lock-in</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-ink-2 leading-relaxed">Tight coupling to a single model provider or managed AI service limits flexibility and creates single points of failure.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-lg border border-line-2 bg-paper p-6" data-reveal>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
          <span class="flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-accent-soft text-sm font-semibold text-accent">12</span>
          <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-ink">Compliance and regulatory pressure</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-ink-2 leading-relaxed">AI systems must comply with GDPR, HIPAA, EU AI Act, and emerging regulations. Audit trails and bias detection are now legal requirements.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- 4. OUR AI ENGINEERING APPROACH -->
<section class="py-20 md:py-28 bg-graphite" aria-labelledby="approach-heading">
  <div class="container-x">
    <SectionHeading
      id="approach-heading"
      index="04"
      label="Our Approach"
      title="A phased methodology for production AI."
      lede="We follow a structured, engineering-driven approach that takes organizations from AI opportunity discovery through continuous improvement. Every engagement is tailored to your business context, technical landscape, and risk tolerance."
      tone="graphite"
    />

    <div class="mt-14 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3" data-reveal-group>
      <div class="rounded-lg border border-graphite-line bg-graphite-2 p-6" data-reveal>
        <span class="block font-mono text-xs text-accent-bright mb-3">01</span>
        <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-graphite-fg mb-2">AI Opportunity Assessment</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-graphite-fg-2 leading-relaxed">Identify high-value AI opportunities across your business. We evaluate technical feasibility, business impact, data availability, and organizational readiness to prioritize the opportunities that deliver the greatest return.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-lg border border-graphite-line bg-graphite-2 p-6" data-reveal>
        <span class="block font-mono text-xs text-accent-bright mb-3">02</span>
        <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-graphite-fg mb-2">AI Strategy</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-graphite-fg-2 leading-relaxed">Define your AI vision, target architecture, capability roadmap, and investment model. We align technology decisions with business objectives and establish the principles that will guide your AI journey.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-lg border border-graphite-line bg-graphite-2 p-6" data-reveal>
        <span class="block font-mono text-xs text-accent-bright mb-3">03</span>
        <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-graphite-fg mb-2">Data Readiness Assessment</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-graphite-fg-2 leading-relaxed">Evaluate data quality, accessibility, privacy, and governance. We identify gaps, recommend improvements, and design data pipelines that feed AI systems with reliable, well-structured data.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-lg border border-graphite-line bg-graphite-2 p-6" data-reveal>
        <span class="block font-mono text-xs text-accent-bright mb-3">04</span>
        <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-graphite-fg mb-2">Solution Architecture</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-graphite-fg-2 leading-relaxed">Design the end-to-end system architecture: model layer, data layer, retrieval, agents, APIs, security boundaries, and integration points with existing enterprise systems.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-lg border border-graphite-line bg-graphite-2 p-6" data-reveal>
        <span class="block font-mono text-xs text-accent-bright mb-3">05</span>
        <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-graphite-fg mb-2">AI Platform Design</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-graphite-fg-2 leading-relaxed">Design the platform layer that enables teams to build, deploy, and monitor AI capabilities consistently. Model serving infrastructure, vector databases, evaluation pipelines, and governance tooling as shared services.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-lg border border-graphite-line bg-graphite-2 p-6" data-reveal>
        <span class="block font-mono text-xs text-accent-bright mb-3">06</span>
        <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-graphite-fg mb-2">Model Selection</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-graphite-fg-2 leading-relaxed">Evaluate and select models based on capability, latency, cost, accuracy, and operational requirements. We maintain deep expertise across proprietary and open-source LLMs, SLMs, and embedding models.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-lg border border-graphite-line bg-graphite-2 p-6" data-reveal>
        <span class="block font-mono text-xs text-accent-bright mb-3">07</span>
        <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-graphite-fg mb-2">Retrieval Architecture</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-graphite-fg-2 leading-relaxed">Design retrieval systems that connect models to your knowledge: embedding pipelines, vector databases, hybrid search, re-ranking, and caching strategies for low-latency, high-accuracy retrieval.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-lg border border-graphite-line bg-graphite-2 p-6" data-reveal>
        <span class="block font-mono text-xs text-accent-bright mb-3">08</span>
        <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-graphite-fg mb-2">Agent Architecture</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-graphite-fg-2 leading-relaxed">Design agent systems that reason, plan, use tools, and execute actions autonomously within defined boundaries. We build single-agent and multi-agent architectures with appropriate supervision and escalation paths.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-lg border border-graphite-line bg-graphite-2 p-6" data-reveal>
        <span class="block font-mono text-xs text-accent-bright mb-3">09</span>
        <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-graphite-fg mb-2">Workflow Design</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-graphite-fg-2 leading-relaxed">Design and implement AI workflows that combine model inference, data processing, human review, and business logic into reliable, observable, and recoverable processes.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-lg border border-graphite-line bg-graphite-2 p-6" data-reveal>
        <span class="block font-mono text-xs text-accent-bright mb-3">10</span>
        <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-graphite-fg mb-2">Deployment</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-graphite-fg-2 leading-relaxed">Deploy AI systems to production with CI/CD pipelines, canary releases, A/B testing, and automated rollback. We ensure that model updates, data changes, and configuration modifications are safe and reversible.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-lg border border-graphite-line bg-graphite-2 p-6" data-reveal>
        <span class="block font-mono text-xs text-accent-bright mb-3">11</span>
        <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-graphite-fg mb-2">Observability</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-graphite-fg-2 leading-relaxed">Instrument every AI interaction: model latency, token usage, retrieval quality, agent decisions, error rates, and user feedback. We build dashboards, alerts, and SLOs for AI system health and performance.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-lg border border-graphite-line bg-graphite-2 p-6" data-reveal>
        <span class="block font-mono text-xs text-accent-bright mb-3">12</span>
        <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-graphite-fg mb-2">Governance</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-graphite-fg-2 leading-relaxed">Establish AI governance frameworks: model registry, approval workflows, bias detection, explainability, audit trails, and compliance reporting. Governance is integrated into the platform, not applied after the fact.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-lg border border-graphite-line bg-graphite-2 p-6 md:col-span-2 lg:col-span-3" data-reveal>
        <span class="block font-mono text-xs text-accent-bright mb-3">13</span>
        <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-graphite-fg mb-2">Continuous Improvement</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-graphite-fg-2 leading-relaxed">AI systems improve through usage. We establish feedback loops, evaluation pipelines, retraining schedules, and performance tracking that drive continuous improvement in accuracy, cost, and user experience.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- 5. AI-NATIVE ENGINEERING SERVICES -->
<section class="py-20 md:py-28" aria-labelledby="services-heading">
  <div class="container-x">
    <SectionHeading
      id="services-heading"
      index="05"
      label="Our Services"
      title="Comprehensive AI engineering capabilities."
      lede="From strategy through managed operations, we provide the full range of services needed to design, build, deploy, and operate AI-native systems at enterprise scale."
    />

    <div class="mt-14 grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3" data-reveal-group>
      <div class="rounded-lg border border-line-2 bg-paper p-7" data-reveal>
        <div class="font-mono text-xs text-accent mb-3">SERVICE</div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-display font-semibold text-ink mb-2">AI Strategy &amp; Consulting</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-ink-2 leading-relaxed mb-4">Define your AI vision, identify high-value opportunities, and build a roadmap aligned with business objectives. We provide fractional AI leadership, architecture reviews, and technology evaluations.</p>
        <ul class="space-y-1.5">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-ink-3"><span class="block h-1 w-1 rounded-full bg-accent" aria-hidden="true" /> AI opportunity assessment</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-ink-3"><span class="block h-1 w-1 rounded-full bg-accent" aria-hidden="true" /> Technology and vendor evaluation</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-ink-3"><span class="block h-1 w-1 rounded-full bg-accent" aria-hidden="true" /> AI operating model design</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-lg border border-line-2 bg-paper p-7" data-reveal>
        <div class="font-mono text-xs text-accent mb-3">SERVICE</div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-display font-semibold text-ink mb-2">AI Platform Engineering</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-ink-2 leading-relaxed mb-4">Design and build internal AI platforms that provide shared infrastructure for model serving, vector storage, evaluation, monitoring, and governance. Enable teams to build AI capabilities without rebuilding infrastructure.</p>
        <ul class="space-y-1.5">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-ink-3"><span class="block h-1 w-1 rounded-full bg-accent" aria-hidden="true" /> Model serving infrastructure</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-ink-3"><span class="block h-1 w-1 rounded-full bg-accent" aria-hidden="true" /> Vector database platform</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-ink-3"><span class="block h-1 w-1 rounded-full bg-accent" aria-hidden="true" /> AI development toolchain</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
